cy"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":"Only you, and the approved contacts who were actually alerted for that emergency. Contacts keep access for 24 hours after it's resolved or cancelled, then lose it automatically. Blocking or removing a contact ends their access immediately. Administrators see redacted activity only (no location, notes or contact details). Security-relevant actions such as invitations, approvals, role changes and emergency actions are audit-logged. Logging of every read of sensitive data is planned but not yet in place."}]]}],["$","article","You approve who joins your circle",{"className":"rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"You approve who joins your circle"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":"When someone accepts your invitation, you see the name, email and phone of the account that accepted, and whether it matches who you invited. Nobody receives your alerts or location until you approve them, so a forwarded invitation link can't silently grant access."}]]}],["$","article","Community helpers",{"className":"rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold","children":"Community helpers"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground","children":"Helpers are opted-in community members whose identity has been checked. They are not police officers or professional responders. They receive only an approximate distance, never your exact location."}]]}],["$","article","Honest status, no false promises",{"className":"rounded-2xl border bg-card p-6 shadow-soft","children":["$Lf","$L10"]}],"$L11","$L12"]}]],null,"$L13"]}]
